WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.400
(whispering) Rainbow candy...

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.300
(whispering) Listen... it's cracking.
[glossy glaze crackling]

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.000
(whispering) Lilac.
[slow squish]

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.500
[delicate crackle]

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.500
(whispering) Matcha... so soft.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.000
[glaze cracking]

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.400
(whispering) And now... under the glaze.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.700
[crispy flakes falling]
[soft foam squish]
